note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, FT7 GaTT. Limited Official Use. Drafted by Selma G. Kallis (E/OT) on May 3;
                    cleared by James H. Lewis (TA), W. Michael Blumenthal (E), Richard D. Vine (EUR/RPE) in substance, and Herter; and approved by Leonard Weiss (OT). Repeated to all NATO capitals
                    except Reykjavik, Athens, and Ankara, and to Bern, Canberra, Stockholm, Tokyo,
                    Vienna, Wellington, Cairo, Helsinki, Karachi, Lima, Montevideo, New Delhi,
                    Pretoria, and Rio de Janeiro.
